Name: Horizon VM
Short Name: horizon_vm
URL: https://github.com/masak1yu/horizon
Version: 0.1.0
License: Apache 2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Horizon VM is a browser-native virtual machine specification and reference
implementation. It provides a stack-based bytecode execution engine with
ring-based privilege levels (hypervisor/kernel/user), page-protected memory,
and a virtual filesystem.

This library implements the VM core (CPU, memory model, bytecode loader) in
platform-independent C++17. The Blink integration lives at:
  third_party/blink/renderer/modules/horizon_vm/

Local Modifications:
None. This is the upstream reference implementation.
